messages.content:
Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: contrib/dbs/xtiff/xtiff.c
Line: 407
Function: GetTIFFHeader
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: tfGrayResponseUnit (read from the TIFF tag via TIFFGetFieldDefaulted) is used as an index into tfGrayResponseUnitMap without bounds checking. The array has 6 elements (indices 0..5). A TIFF with an invalid GrayResponseUnit value > 5 will index past the end of tfGrayResponseUnitMap, causing an out-of-bounds read.

Source context:
```c
